gas-spill-plasma = Monitoring systems have detected an imminent release of plasma from the Supermatter Crystal. The engineering team must ensure the secondary power surge is within expected parameters.
gas-spill-oxygen = Monitoring systems have detected an imminent release of oxygen from the Supermatter Crystal. The engineering team is advised to monitor and intervene if necessary.
gas-spill-nitrogen = Monitoring systems have detected an imminent release of nitrogen from the Supermatter Crystal. The engineering team is advised to monitor and intervene if necessary.
gas-spill-carbondioxide = Monitoring systems have detected an imminent release of carbon dioxide from the Supermatter Crystal. The engineering team must ensure the secondary power surge is within expected parameters.
gas-spill-frezon = Monitoring systems have detected an imminent release of frezon from the Supermatter Crystal. The engineering team is advised to correct the unstable temperature anomaly.
supermatter-energy-surge = Passive safety systems predict a substantial energy emission from the Supermatter Crystal. The engineering team is advised to monitor and intervene if necessary.
supermatter-surge = Active safety systems have flagged a strong surge of activity within the Supermatter Crystal. The engineering team must contain the surge. Remaining personnel must vacate the Supermatter's vicinity immediately.

